1,0 $ Apothecia campanulate (verpoid, bell-shaped)  .$Scleromitrula(see also Episclerotium L. M. Kohn (Leotiaceae), Kohn & Nagasawa, 1984)
1,2 $ Apothecia cupulate to discoid (cup- or saucer-shaped)  . 2.
