18,0 $ Stroma up to 1mm thick, elongate, to 10 mm broad and 30 mm long, surrounding the midrib of overwintering leaves, ± detached from leaf-plate, well differentiated into a cortex and medulla. Apothecial stipe slender, up to 25 mm long .$ Ciborinia
18,19 $ Stroma not well differentiated . . 19.
