22,0 $  Apothecia short-stipitate, margin radially splitting in a stellate manner, hymenium pale yellowish-brown, outside brownish-black, associated with a macroconidial anamorphic state consisting of arthroconidia in chains (form genus Acarosporium ) borne in pycnidia .$ Pycnopeziza
22,23 $ Apothecia long-stipitate, brown, macroconidial anamorphic state wanting . 23.
23,0 $  Apothecia from stromata without an obvious stromatal rind  $Ciboria
23,0 $ Apothecia from a discoid or crustlike stroma with a determinate stromatal rind. (see also Scleromitrula candolleana )  $Ciborinia
24,25 $ On hosts of monocots  . 25.
