30,0 $  Associated with a Botrytis macroconidial anamorphic state borne on free conidiophores .$ Botryotinia
30,0 $ Associated with a macroconidial state of arthroconidia in chains (form genus Acarosporium ) borne in pycnidia  $Pycnopeziza
31,32 $ Stroma a determinate sclerotium; discoid, crustlike, pyramidal, globose or loaf-shaped with a well differentiated rind and medulla . 32.
31,0 $ Stroma crustlike, without an obvious stromatal rind  .$ Ciboria
32,0 $  Stroma pyramidal, globose or loaf-shaped  .$ Sclerotinia
32,0 $ Stroma discoid or crust-like  . $Ciborinia
